# Packmule Treat (the Minimule) for 1,500 Merchant's Favor from the supply
# camps, at Revered with the camp's faction.
# Sources: NPCs 256389 / 256384 / 256390 / 256386 (positions); Forever's client
# data (ItemSparse 284664: binds when picked up, no standing on the item).
# The Favor price and the Revered gate are vendor rules the client item table
# does not hold: they follow beta vendor lists, as in the Supply Factions
# Reputation guide. Crate pay (5/10/15 Favor for plain bundles, 10/20/30 for
# crafted ones) is from beta reports. Merchant's Favor is a currency Polestar
# cannot count.
# INGAME: does Tamelyn Aldridge or Gishah sell the Packmule Treat below Revered?
# (beta vendor lists say Revered; the client item carries no standing).

step Azeroth Commerce Authority
  only Alliance
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip The Alliance camp is at Three Corners in western Redridge Mountains. Merchant's Favor comes from Waylaid Crates that mobs drop from level 10: fill one with a bundle it lists and hand it to Marcy Baker, for 5 to 30 Favor a crate. The treat costs 1,500 Favor and, by beta vendor lists, needs Revered with the Azeroth Commerce Authority. Crates pay no standing: that comes from the Craftsman's Writs, 21,000 from Neutral to Revered. The Supply Factions Reputation guide takes you there.
  vendor 256389 "Tamelyn Aldridge" @10.6,71.3 live
  buy 284664 "Packmule Treat" npc 256389 @10.6,71.3 live -- 1,500 Merchant's Favor

step Durotar Supply and Logistics
  only Horde
  zone The Barrens
  tip The Horde camp is just outside the west gate of the Crossroads. Merchant's Favor comes from Waylaid Crates that mobs drop from level 10: fill one with a bundle it lists and hand it to Dokimi, for 5 to 30 Favor a crate. The treat costs 1,500 Favor and, by beta vendor lists, needs Revered with Durotar Supply and Logistics. Crates pay no standing: that comes from the Craftsman's Writs, 21,000 from Neutral to Revered. The Supply Factions Reputation guide takes you there. (Another Gishah stands in the Undercity; this is the one at the camp.)
  vendor 256384 "Gishah" @49.4,29.4
  buy 284664 "Packmule Treat" npc 256384 @49.4,29.4 -- 1,500 Merchant's Favor
